doc:
Contract leverage comparison data for a single instrument.

# API Response Format
```json
{
"instId": "ETH-USDT-SWAP",
"mgnMode": "isolated",
"copierLeverDataVos": [
{"lever": "3", "posSide": "long"},
{"lever": "3", "posSide": "short"}
],
"traderLeverDataVos": [
{"lever": "12.9", "posSide": "long"},
{"lever": "12.9", "posSide": "short"}
]
}
```

